ss worth it then?", "a": "audio/t01/s01.mp3", "hl": [96, 104], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t01o/s01.mp3", "oab": [6.16, 7.9]}, "tt": {"w": 24.09, "ex": [["If", 26.65], ["something", 26.82], ["is", 27.39], ["worth", 29.98], ["it,", 29.98], ["the", 29.98], ["good", 29.98], ["part", 29.98], ["is", 29.98], ["bigger", 29.98], ["than", 29.98], ["the", 29.98], ["cost", 29.98], ["or", 29.98], ["the", 29.98], ["effort.", 29.98], ["You", 31.08], ["are", 31.16], ["glad", 31.3], ["you", 31.56], ["did", 31.94], ["it.", 32.16], ["People", 32.78], ["often", 32.94], ["ask,", 33.36], ["is", 33.78], ["it", 34.2], ["worth", 34.3], ["it?", 34.52]], "exs": [[["The", 37.76], ["training", 37.97], ["was", 38.08], ["expensive,", 38.38], ["but", 39.08], ["it", 39.64], ["was", 39.72], ["totally", 39.84], ["worth", 40.18], ["it.", 40.58]], [["Waking", 41.94], ["up", 42.2], ["early", 42.46], ["is", 42.72], ["hard,", 43.0], ["but", 43.58], ["it's", 43.68], ["worth", 43.84], ["it.", 44.06]]]}}, {"n": 3, "w": "statement", "pos": "n.", "zh": "说法；陈述；声明", "ex": "A statement is something you say or write that tells an idea or a fact. When Naval says that statement, he means a sentence he said before.", "exs": ["That's a strong statement. Do you really believe it?", "The salon made a statement about the new prices."], "t": 45.22, "src": {"t": "Oof. I’m not sure that statement is true anymore.", "a": "audio/t01/s02.mp3", "hl": [23, 32], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t01o/s02.mp3", "oab": [0.0, 4.81]}, "tt": {"w": 45.22, "ex": [["A", 47.92], ["statement", 48.04], ["is", 48.65], ["something", 48.65], ["you", 48.84], ["say", 49.18], ["or", 49.44], ["write", 49.8], ["that", 50.12], ["tells", 50.4], ["an", 50.72], ["idea", 50.9], ["or", 51.28], ["a", 51.66], ["fact.", 51.76], ["When", 52.96], ["Naval", 53.12], ["says", 53.28], ["that", 53.52], ["statement,", 53.8], ["he", 54.78], ["means", 54.82], ["a", 55.0], ["sentence", 55.22], ["he", 55.62], ["said", 55.88], ["before.", 56.1]], "exs": [[["That's", 59.54], 