ook", 128.37], ["simple,", 128.66], ["but", 129.12], ["the", 129.12], ["technique", 129.12], ["is", 129.12], ["complicated.", 129.49]], [["It's", 132.34], ["complicated.", 132.62], ["I'll", 133.35], ["explain", 133.64], ["it", 133.64], ["later.", 133.64]]]}}, {"n": 7, "w": "marketplace", "pos": "n.", "zh": "集市；市场", "ex": "A marketplace is an open place in a town where people buy and sell things. Today it can also mean any place to buy and sell, like an online marketplace.", "exs": ["We walked around the marketplace and tried some street food.", "She sells her lash products on an online marketplace."], "t": 135.74, "src": {"t": "where he goes into the marketplace and they show him all these luxuries and fineries and he says, “How many things there are in this world that I do not want,”", "a": "audio/t01/s06.mp3", "hl": [23, 34], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t01o/s06.mp3", "oab": [1.15, 4.15]}, "tt": {"w": 135.74, "ex": [["A", 138.64], ["marketplace", 138.78], ["is", 139.56], ["an", 139.76], ["open", 139.96], ["place", 140.28], ["in", 140.68], ["a", 140.68], ["town", 140.68], ["where", 140.68], ["people", 140.68], ["buy", 140.97], ["and", 141.57], ["sell", 142.17], ["things.", 142.78], ["Today", 143.38], ["it", 144.2], ["can", 144.32], ["also", 144.46], ["mean", 144.78], ["any", 145.1], ["place", 145.3], ["to", 145.64], ["buy", 145.84], ["and", 146.04], ["sell,", 146.4], ["like", 147.26], ["an", 147.48], ["online", 147.58], ["marketplace.", 147.86]], "exs": [[["We", 151.93], ["walked", 152.0], ["around", 152.18], ["the", 152.52], ["marketplace", 152.72], ["and", 153.06], ["tried", 153.82], ["some", 154.08], ["street", 154.38], ["food.", 154.66]], [["She", 156.25], ["sells", 156.36], ["her", 156.56], ["lash", 156.84], ["products", 157.06], ["on", 157.54], ["an", 158.06], ["online", 158.06], ["marketplace.", 158.32]]]}}, {"n": 8, "w": "luxury", "pos": "n.", "zh": "奢侈品；奢华", "ex": "A luxury is something nice and expensive that you enjoy but do not really need. Luxuries is 